:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Solar-Panels-Stock-Photo-768x505.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Solar-Panels-Stock-Photo-1536x1010.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Solar-Panels-Stock-Photo-2048x1347.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc2dae5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dc2dae5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44aa631 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"44aa631\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p>Single crystal furnaces play a critical role in the photovoltaic industry, where consistent performance and cost-efficiency are key. However, the traditional use of graphite felt as an insulation material for the soft hearth of these furnaces presents significant challenges. Poor thermal conductivity and a high ablation rate lead to frequent maintenance, with materials typically requiring replacement every two years.<\/p><p>At Vulcan Shield Global (VSG), we\u2019ve developed an innovative solution to these challenges: <strong>Alumina Fiber Needled Blankets<\/strong>. This advanced material outperforms graphite felt in insulation properties, strength, and durability, making it the ideal choice for single crystal furnace insulation.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d20529f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d20529f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>The Challenges of Graphite Felt<\/h2><p><\/p><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb89f00 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fb89f00\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Graphite felt, despite being widely used, struggles with key performance issues:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Poor thermal conductivity<\/strong> at lower temperatures, leading to inefficient energy use.<\/li><li><strong>High ablation rates<\/strong>, resulting in faster material degradation.<\/li><li><b>Frequent maintenance requirements<\/b>, adding to operational costs.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b00f4ee e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b00f4ee\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5a6ffc0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5a6ffc0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>Alumina Fiber: A Superior Alternative<\/h2><p><\/p><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba7402a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ba7402a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>VSG\u2019s alumina fiber needled blankets provide a game-changing alternative to graphite felt. Extensive 3rd party testing reveals the following advantages:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-686f391 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"686f391\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>1. Exceptional Thermal Conductivity<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87576ea elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"87576ea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Test results show that at 1200\u00b0C, the thermal conductivity of alumina fiber blankets is equivalent to viscose graphite felt. However, below 1100\u00b0C, alumina fiber blankets outperform graphite felt with lower thermal conductivity, resulting in <strong>better energy-saving performance<\/strong>. The benefits become even more pronounced at lower temperatures, providing a significant edge in energy efficiency.<\/p><ul><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1376f5d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1376f5d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac2415d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ac2415d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"506\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Thermal-Conductivity-Comparison-1024x809.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1296\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Thermal-Conductivity-Comparison-1024x809.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Thermal-Conductivity-Comparison-300x237.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Thermal-Conductivity-Comparison-768x607.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Thermal-Conductivity-Comparison.png 1374w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-68c3c09 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"68c3c09\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><i>Thermal Conductivity Test Comparison Between Alumina Fiber and Viscose Graphite Felt<\/i><\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c508492 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c508492\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e115ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6e115ff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>2. Superior Tensile Strength<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a33b307 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a33b307\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Independent testing from a 3rd party testing facility shows that VSG\u2019s alumina fiber needled blanket has a tensile strength of <strong>256.9 KPa<\/strong> in the length direction, compared to only <strong>76.42 KPa<\/strong> for viscose carbon felt. This higher tensile strength ensures:<\/p><ul><li>Greater durability<\/li><li>Reduced risk of damage during assembly and disassembly of insulation materials<\/li><li>Longer operational lifespan<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bcb62ec e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bcb62ec\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4895194 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4895194\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>3. Unmatched Ablation Resistance<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afbbe6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"afbbe6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Graphite felt, primarily made of carbon, begins to disintegrate at temperatures as low as 300\u00b0C. In contrast, VSG\u2019s alumina fiber blanket demonstrates <strong>0% Loss on Ignition (LOI)<\/strong> at 1050\u00b0C for 1 hour, showcasing its superior ability to withstand high temperatures without degradation.\u00a0<\/p><p>View the GDMS of graphite felt and ablation test of VSGs alumina fiber blanket below.\u00a0<\/p><ul><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21aa7e5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"21aa7e5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c422208 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c422208\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1542a1e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1542a1e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"614\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Chemical-Composition-of-Viscose-Graphite-Felt-2-1024x982.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1292\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Chemical-Composition-of-Viscose-Graphite-Felt-2-1024x982.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Chemical-Composition-of-Viscose-Graphite-Felt-2-300x288.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Chemical-Composition-of-Viscose-Graphite-Felt-2-768x737.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Chemical-Composition-of-Viscose-Graphite-Felt-2.png 1353w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7754394 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7754394\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><i>VSG\u2019s Needled Blanket displays 0% LOI at 1050\u00b0C at 1 hour.<\/i><\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9f51d1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e9f51d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e11b20f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e11b20f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"905\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket-724x1024.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1287\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket-724x1024.png 724w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket-212x300.png 212w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket-768x1086.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket-1086x1536.png 1086w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Ablation-Test-Needled-Blanket.png 1414w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98854b2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"98854b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><i>VSG\u2019s Needled Blanket displays 0% LOI at 1050\u00b0C at 1 hour.<\/i><\/b><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb7cfb3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bb7cfb3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11d6525 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"11d6525\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h3><strong>4. Cost-Effectiveness<\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-primary ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-primary-font-weight ); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><\/span><\/h3><\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4921c5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4921c5b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Preliminary tests conducted by a leading photovoltaic green energy firm demonstrate that alumina fiber blankets are a more cost-effective solution than carbon fiber felt due to:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Stronger Oxidation Resistance<\/strong>: Alumina fiber blankets can operate in aerobic environments for extended periods, significantly extending service life.<\/li><li><strong>Energy Efficiency<\/strong>: Replacing 50% of the carbon felt in the bottom insulation layer of a single crystal furnace with alumina fiber resulted in energy savings of <strong>1 kW per hour<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>Longer Service Life<\/strong>: Alumina fiber blankets last <strong>more than twice as long<\/strong> as carbon fiber felt.<\/li><li><strong>Lower Cost<\/strong>: While alumina fiber blankets cost less than double the price of carbon felt, they deliver significantly greater value.<\/li><\/ul><ul><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c610dce e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c610dce\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;full&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a0bffc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4a0bffc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><h2>A Greener Future with Alumina Fiber<\/h2><p><\/p><\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f98f55b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f98f55b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>With our <strong>Guangxi production base<\/strong> set to commence operations next month in December 2024, Vulcan Shield Global is poised to offer even more competitive pricing for our products. This positions alumina fiber as an affordable, high-performance solution for the continued evolution of insulation materials in the photovoltaic industry.<\/p><ul><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08ba355 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"08ba355\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Explore the advantages of VSG\u2019s alumina fiber needled blanket and revolutionize your furnace performance with a cost-effective, energy-efficient, and 